WEBVTT

00:05:58.917 --> 00:06:02.226
And I was like, "Yes.
I am ecstatic right now.

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:03.559
(Laughter)

00:06:03.583 --> 00:06:05.417
I cannot be more delighted."

00:06:07.292 --> 00:06:09.583
But inside, I was really afraid.

00:06:10.458 --> 00:06:12.083
But I couldn't tell you that.

00:06:13.375 --> 00:06:14.643
So instead, I said,

00:06:14.667 --> 00:06:16.583
"Hey, go off and have a wonderful day."

00:06:20.417 --> 00:06:22.309
And you left,

00:06:22.333 --> 00:06:24.333
and I was left with Sekou.

00:06:26.292 --> 00:06:28.476
What I understand now about that moment

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:30.893
is that we were fostering a trust